"Adding a meaningful Subject line to your messages will give your recipients "
"an idea of what your mail is about."
msgstr "Mezuaren gaian lerro esanguratsu bat idaztean jasotzaileei zure mezuaren edukiari buruz argibideak ematen diezu."

